WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:06.080
I used to have nothing.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:14.160
And then I got this job..

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.560
this family..

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.440
But nothing lasts forever

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:29.800
Heard you had to leave in a hurry.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.780
It's never easy these days.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.440
So what are you going to do?

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:38.660
I've lived a lot of lives

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.280
but I'm done running from my past.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.720
I know you're out there.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.760
I know you know I'm out here.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:49.040
So are we gonna talk like grown-ups?

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:52.480
Is that what we are?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.920
It's good to see you too, sis.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:09.320
What brings you home?

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.560
We have unfinished business.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.380
We have to go back to where it all started.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:23.860
Lucky us.

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:28.560
One thing's for sure. It's gonna be a hell of a reunion.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.000
It still fits.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:38.980
Family..

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:41.980
back together again.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:44.380
You got fat.

